  ["Cue_E5_2A_ArtClass_BellRing_Jefferson_010"] = "And guys, don't forget the deadline to submit a photo in the \"Everyday Heroes\" contest. I'll fly out with the winner to San Francisco where you'll be feted by the art world. It's great exposure, and it can kickstart a career in photography. So, Stella and Alyssa, get it together. Taylor, don't hide. I'm still waiting for your entry, too. And yes, Max, I see you pretending not to see me.\n",
