  ["Cue_E5_7B_ArtClass_JeffGivingLesson_Jefferson_010"] = "Now, can you give me an example of a photographer who perfectly captured the human condition in black and white? Anybody? Bueller?",
  ["Play_Cue_E5_7B_ArtClass_JeffGivingLesson_Jefferson_010"] = "Now, can you give me an example of a photographer who perfectly captured the human condition in black and white? Anybody? Bueller?",
